    "reviews": "\u201cA true to life experience detailing how customer service really works.\u201d<br />\r\n10/10 \u2013 kpolupo<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI enjoyed how many things were flammable in the store.\u201d<br />\r\n5/5 \u2013 mr_srsbsns<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI've only known that talking little crow plushie in MageMart for a day and a half but if anything happened to him I would petrify everyone in this store and then myself.\u201d<br />\r\n7/7 \u2013 neondenki<br />\r\n",
